{
  "1145647": {
    "active": true,
    "notes": "node-tar uncontrolled-recursion DoS (GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m; supersedes retired advisory ID 1124287). Remaining path is the copy bundled inside npm (semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm > tar@7.5.19); npm ships it as a bundledDependency, so an override cannot reach it, and even the latest npm 11.x (11.19.0, verified 2026-08-24) still bundles a vulnerable tar. Dev-only, not shipped in the published package. No fix until npm releases an updated bundle. Review 2026-10-01.",
    "expiry": "2026-10-01"
  },
  "1130591": {
    "active": true,
    "notes": "brace-expansion DoS via unbounded expansion length (GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg). Remaining path is the copy bundled inside npm (semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm > brace-expansion@5.0.7); npm ships it as a bundledDependency, so the package.json override to >=5.0.9 that patches the rest of the tree cannot reach it (verified still bundled in npm 11.19.0 on 2026-08-20). Dev-only, not shipped in the published package. No fix until npm releases an updated bundle. Review 2026-10-01.",
    "expiry": "2026-10-01"
  },
  "1130734": {
    "active": true,
